            "privateNotes": "",
            "publicNotes": "<p>An immense, gnarled tree awoken with raw, primal power by one of the Eldest of the First World, this legendary Tane skitters on huge, spidery roots and thrashes their branches. Fiery lightning courses within their blackened bark, a living manifestation of the violent clash between ancient forest and stormy sky. Sards are created as living siege engines, awoken by the Eldest when the target of their ire tries to hide behind stone walls and high battlements. The blood-red lightning that runs through a sard's twisted trunk instead of sap makes short work of such mortal defenses, great arcs of electricity tearing through stone and those that hide behind it. As representations of the cataclysmic destruction of serene beauty, sards take cruel glee in their work.</p>",
